**Known for**: Free Software Foundation, GNU, GCC

**Alias**: rms

Richard is the founder of the Free Software Foundation and one of the most
important figures in getting this whole thing off of the ground. Also the
subject of credible rumors of harassing a lot of women over the years, and
frequently writes on his website in defense of rapists, sexual harassment,
sexual exploitation of minors, distribution of child sexual abuse material, and
even bestiality and necrophilia. Stallman's behavior is extensively covered in
The Stallman Report.[[source]][0]

